# lagoon shell — real capture (run from a project dir with lagoon.toml)
Output assets/shell.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1100
Set Height 460
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/code/myapp && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "lagoon shell"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s

Type "python3 --version"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "uname -sm"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "exit"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
